{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49884","headline":"木兰花 一 · 许岷","name":"木兰花 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小庭日晚花零落，倚户无聊妆脸薄。\n宝筝金鸭任生尘，绣画工夫全放却。\n有时觑着同心结，万恨千愁无处说。\n当初不合尽饶伊，赢得如今长恨别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许岷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}